<section class="page-heading wrap"><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT PLANNING TOOLS</p><h1>Make the assumptions<br>work harder.</h1><p class="lede">Transparent calculations, driven by your inputs. These tools provide planning arithmetic, not quotations or professional estimates.</p></section><section class="wrap section calculator-grid"><form id="cost-calculator" class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">01 / BUDGET</p><h2>Project cost calculator</h2><label>Floor area (m²)<input name="area" type="number" min="1" step="any" required></label><label>Your construction rate per m²<input name="rate" type="number" min="0.01" step="any" required></label><label>Contingency (%)<input name="contingency" type="number" value="10" min="0" max="100" step="any" required></label><button class="button">Calculate</button><output aria-live="polite"></output><p class="fine">Area × rate × (1 + contingency / 100). In the currency of your rate. Excludes land, finance, tax and professional fees unless included in that rate.</p></form><form id="time-calculator" class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">02 / PROGRAMME</p><h2>Activity duration</h2><label>Quantity of work<input name="quantity" type="number" min="0.01" step="any" required></label><label>Output per crew per day<input name="productivity" type="number" min="0.01" step="any" required></label><label>Number of crews<input name="crews" type="number" min="1" step="1" required></label><button class="button">Calculate</button><output aria-live="polite"></output><p class="fine">Quantity ÷ (daily output × crews), rounded up. Working days only; does not account for dependencies, access limits, weather or approvals.</p></form><form id="roi-calculator" class="panel"><p class="eyebrow">03 / VALUE</p><h2>Consultancy scenario</h2><label>Anticipated gross savings<input name="savings" type="number" min="0" step="any" required></label><label>Consultancy fee<input name="fee" type="number" min="0.01" step="any" required></label><button class="button">Calculate</button><output aria-live="polite"></output><p class="fine">(Anticipated savings − fee) ÷ fee × 100. A scenario based on your assumptions, not a promise of returns.</p></form></section>
